WEBVTT

1
00:54:41.954 --> 00:54:46.954
Sounds good, right? Isn't it nice? Jamming with the spirit. Delightful.

2
00:54:54.954 --> 00:54:57.954
So they keep playing during the sermon, is that okay?

3
00:54:57.954 --> 00:55:01.954
No? No? Yes, then there can't be a sermon.

4
00:55:04.954 --> 00:55:06.954
Delightful.

5
00:55:07.954 --> 00:55:09.954
May I have a round of applause for our band? They are really amazing, aren't they?

6
00:55:09.954 --> 00:55:11.954
Love it. Love it.

7
00:55:16.954 --> 00:55:21.954
Next week, May 24, is Pentecost.

8
00:55:21.954 --> 00:55:26.954
That is the coming of the Holy Spirit, more than 2000 years ago.

9
00:55:26.954 --> 00:55:28.954
We need Him, the Holy Spirit.

10
00:55:28.954 --> 00:55:30.954
Without the Holy Spirit, no repentance.

11
00:55:30.954 --> 00:55:33.954
If you don't know the Father, you can't read the Bible, you can't come to repentance.

12
00:55:33.954 --> 00:55:36.954
You know nothing, no wisdom.

13
00:55:36.954 --> 00:55:38.954
The Holy Spirit, we need Him.

14
00:55:39.954 --> 00:55:46.954
In the coming days, so this is the first time we have applied it this way in the calendar.

15
00:55:46.954 --> 00:55:53.954
Normally we would fast and pray for ten days at the beginning of the year.

16
00:55:53.954 --> 00:55:55.954
Great.

17
00:55:55.954 --> 00:56:02.954
But now we are going to follow the pattern where we will pray and fast in anticipation.

18
00:56:02.954 --> 00:56:07.954
That we tell our bodies that we need the Holy Spirit more than anything else.

19
00:56:07.954 --> 00:56:14.954
That is why we fast and pray during the week, leading up to Pentecost.

20
00:56:14.954 --> 00:56:16.954
And I want to ask you to join in.

21
00:56:16.954 --> 00:56:23.954
Join in, to the extent that you can contribute, join in.

22
00:56:23.954 --> 00:56:27.954
In the coming days, Vanessa will give teaching about it shortly.

23
00:56:27.954 --> 00:56:33.954
About what we are going to do, why, the coming of the Holy Spirit, the ascension of Jesus.

24
00:56:33.954 --> 00:56:38.954
If Jesus had not gone to heaven, had not taken his seat on the throne, the Holy Spirit could not have returned either.

25
00:56:38.954 --> 00:56:42.954
That sequence is all necessary. It is an order from God.

26
00:56:42.954 --> 00:56:45.954
These are not our own plans, it is God's order. Amen.

27
00:56:45.954 --> 00:56:49.954
So next week, 24.05, Pentecost weekend.

28
00:56:49.954 --> 00:56:56.954
This note says that Tim and Vanessa have been pastors of this church for ten years now.

29
00:56:57.954 --> 00:57:01.954
