30
00:57:01.954 --> 00:57:05.954
I can only say that this is the best church.

31
00:57:05.954 --> 00:57:08.954
Here, Open Church. We are the best church.

32
00:57:08.954 --> 00:57:10.954
I am just being very honest.

33
00:57:10.954 --> 00:57:14.954
And that is not arrogance, but it is appropriate pride.

34
00:57:14.954 --> 00:57:17.954
I am extremely happy with Open Church.

35
00:57:17.954 --> 00:57:20.954
I love this church. You are my group of friends.

36
00:57:20.954 --> 00:57:22.954
Once again, this is it.

37
00:57:22.954 --> 00:57:27.954
And if you don't like it, stick to it, because this is it.

38
00:57:27.954 --> 00:57:31.954
We are us. Amen. I love it.

39
00:57:31.954 --> 00:57:33.954
So we get to do this for ten years already.

40
00:57:33.954 --> 00:57:36.954
And I think we will stick around for another twenty or thirty years.

41
00:57:36.954 --> 00:57:39.954
Hallelujah. Then the church is also 43 years old.

42
00:57:39.954 --> 00:57:43.954
I am 43 years old. I am as old as the church.

43
00:57:43.954 --> 00:57:47.954
So you see, this is what a church looks like, approximately.

44
00:57:48.954 --> 00:57:53.954
43 years of church. And then we conclude our fasting period.

45
00:57:53.954 --> 00:57:57.954
And then there is a party lunch, it says here.

46
00:57:57.954 --> 00:58:01.954
