47
00:58:01.954 --> 00:58:05.954
Until 3 PM. After that, we will send you home. So that is very nice.

48
00:58:05.954 --> 00:58:07.954
Please look at the church agenda.

49
00:58:07.954 --> 00:58:11.954
We have an app for those people who have just joined Open Church.

50
00:58:11.954 --> 00:58:13.954
We have an app from Open Church.

51
00:58:13.954 --> 00:58:17.954
You can simply find the Open Church app in the app store.

52
00:58:17.954 --> 00:58:19.954
And then you can download it.

53
00:58:19.954 --> 00:58:21.954
Praise the Lord.

54
00:58:21.954 --> 00:58:25.954
I also get to present the offerings today.

55
00:58:25.954 --> 00:58:30.954
And I can only say, I am so happy with Open Church.

56
00:58:30.954 --> 00:58:34.954
We are such a cool church. Amazing.

57
00:58:34.954 --> 00:58:36.954
And I want to thank you all.

58
00:58:36.954 --> 00:58:40.954
Last week you listened to the teaching.

59
00:58:40.954 --> 00:58:43.954
The teaching was also the offerings.

60
00:58:43.954 --> 00:58:47.954
And you may show picture 1. It is just simple.

61
00:58:47.954 --> 00:58:50.954
We just made a simple picture.

62
00:58:50.954 --> 00:58:52.954
Hey, Jeroen, your name is on this.

63
00:58:52.954 --> 00:58:55.954
Yes, I see it. Come here, buddy.

64
00:58:57.954 --> 00:59:00.954
With your wife.

65
00:59:03.954 --> 00:59:07.954
Jeroen and Wesley, you were also with Jeroen, right?

66
00:59:07.954 --> 00:59:11.954
Right? Were there more people with you?

67
00:59:11.954 --> 00:59:14.954
Who then? Come here.

68
00:59:15.954 --> 00:59:17.954
But they were gone.

69
00:59:17.954 --> 00:59:22.954
And at the moment they were away on a mission trip...

70
00:59:22.954 --> 00:59:25.954
we as a church, as a home base...

71
00:59:25.954 --> 00:59:29.954
