72
00:59:29.954 --> 00:59:31.954
And about his work.

73
00:59:32.954 --> 00:59:37.954
That is healthy. When we talk about you, it is positive.

74
00:59:37.954 --> 00:59:40.954
I was thinking about the book of Acts.

75
00:59:40.954 --> 00:59:43.954
And in the book of Acts it also says, for example...

76
00:59:43.954 --> 00:59:47.954
Paul is glad that money can be given...

77
00:59:47.954 --> 00:59:51.954
