81
01:00:01.954 --> 01:00:04.954
Your ministry can be in the Kempen.

82
01:00:04.954 --> 01:00:06.954
There are so many things in the Kempen.

83
01:00:06.954 --> 01:00:10.954
In the Kempen, I can still name 10,000 different initiatives...

84
01:00:10.954 --> 01:00:13.954
