90
01:00:28.954 --> 01:00:31.954
And we can also give money.

91
01:00:31.954 --> 01:00:34.954
And God has blessed us for that.

92
01:00:34.954 --> 01:00:37.954
We are blessed in this part of the world.

93
01:00:37.954 --> 01:00:39.954
Did you know that the Netherlands and Belgium...

94
01:00:39.954 --> 01:00:43.954
have one of the highest purchasing powers in the world?

95
01:00:43.954 --> 01:00:45.954
Purchasing power simply means.

96
01:00:45.954 --> 01:00:48.954
Purchasing power is your money that comes in...

97
01:00:48.954 --> 01:00:50.954
