98
01:00:50.954 --> 01:00:52.954
what is left over.

99
01:00:52.954 --> 01:00:55.954
Where you can go get sushi once.

100
01:00:55.954 --> 01:00:58.954
Where you can buy a nice shirt once.

101
01:00:58.954 --> 01:01:01.954
Instead of sailor underwear, you can also get a nice t-shirt once in a while.

102
01:01:01.954 --> 01:01:03.954
Do you understand what I mean?

103
01:01:03.954 --> 01:01:05.954
That is purchasing power.

104
01:01:05.954 --> 01:01:08.954
It's funny, but did you know that our countries...

105
01:01:08.954 --> 01:01:12.954
has one of the highest purchasing powers in the world?

106
01:01:12.954 --> 01:01:14.954
That is blessing.

107
01:01:14.954 --> 01:01:16.954
Every time I sit at the table...

108
01:01:16.954 --> 01:01:19.954
and it has really been bubbling up in me for the last 2, 3 years...

109
01:01:19.954 --> 01:01:22.954
when I sit at the table or am having a sandwich with someone...

110
01:01:22.954 --> 01:01:24.954
then I say I want to take a moment.

111
01:01:24.954 --> 01:01:26.954
I don't want to take it for granted.

112
01:01:26.954 --> 01:01:30.954
I don't want to be indifferent about the blessing that is in my life.

113
01:01:30.954 --> 01:01:33.954
So then I say thank you here that I can just walk into a store...

114
01:01:33.954 --> 01:01:35.954
and that I can just look around.

115
01:01:35.954 --> 01:01:37.954
There is an abundance of supply.

116
01:01:37.954 --> 01:01:40.954
And that I can choose what I want to eat.

117
01:01:40.954 --> 01:01:42.954
That is really a blessing.

118
01:01:42.954 --> 01:01:44.954
But I am not blessed to be blessed.

119
01:01:44.954 --> 01:01:46.954
That is not what the Bible says.

120
01:01:46.954 --> 01:01:49.954
I am blessed to bless.

121
01:01:49.954 --> 01:01:51.954
I think that's awesome.

122
01:01:51.954 --> 01:01:53.954
May I remind you all...

123
01:01:53.954 --> 01:01:55.954
that about a few weeks ago...

124
01:01:55.954 --> 01:01:58.954
we had a collection for the building project.

125
01:01:58.954 --> 01:02:00.954
We received 10,000 euros for that.

126
01:02:00.954 --> 01:02:02.954
Right? Super.

127
01:02:02.954 --> 01:02:03.954
Thank you, church.

128
01:02:03.954 --> 01:02:05.954
Together we are going to build this building.

129
01:02:05.954 --> 01:02:07.954
This one for the generations and that one for the generations.

130
01:02:07.954 --> 01:02:09.954
Amen.

131
01:02:09.954 --> 01:02:11.954
But what I find so awesome is...

132
01:02:11.954 --> 01:02:14.954
that as an open church we also...

133
01:02:14.954 --> 01:02:17.954
not only think about what comes into our bank account...

134
01:02:17.954 --> 01:02:19.954
for our projects.

135
01:02:19.954 --> 01:02:23.954
But that we can be enthusiastic together in Christ...

136
01:02:23.954 --> 01:02:26.954
for helping the global ministry.

137
01:02:26.954 --> 01:02:28.954
For God's kingdom is not only in the Kempen.

138
01:02:28.954 --> 01:02:30.954
It is worldwide. Amen.

139
01:02:30.954 --> 01:02:34.954
So last week we gave.

140
01:02:34.954 --> 01:02:35.954
That has been added up.

141
01:02:35.954 --> 01:02:37.954
We already had a small fund set up...

142
01:02:37.954 --> 01:02:39.954
for the donations that are already coming in.

143
01:02:39.954 --> 01:02:40.954
We are just saving that.

144
01:02:40.954 --> 01:02:42.954
For example, if you transfer something to open church...

145
01:02:42.954 --> 01:02:45.954
and you specify it with a note...

146
01:02:45.954 --> 01:02:48.954
we will use it as stated.

147
01:02:48.954 --> 01:02:49.954
Do you understand what I mean?

148
01:02:49.954 --> 01:02:51.954
It is indeed a small fund.

149
01:02:51.954 --> 01:02:54.954
But just look at what we collected last week.

150
01:02:54.954 --> 01:02:55.954
1, 2, 3.

151
01:02:55.954 --> 01:02:56.954
Bam.

152
01:02:56.954 --> 01:03:02.954
APPLAUSE

153
01:03:02.954 --> 01:03:04.954
Isn't it just incredible?

154
01:03:04.954 --> 01:03:06.954
Can we be a bit louder with our applause?

155
01:03:06.954 --> 01:03:08.954
Please. It's really awesome.

156
01:03:08.954 --> 01:03:10.954
APPLAUSE

157
01:03:10.954 --> 01:03:12.954
It's awesome.

158
01:03:16.954 --> 01:03:17.954
Amen.

159
01:03:17.954 --> 01:03:19.954
Is this awesome or what?

160
01:03:21.954 --> 01:03:23.954
Dear church...

161
01:03:23.954 --> 01:03:26.954
with this money we could actually use it better ourselves...

162
01:03:26.954 --> 01:03:28.954
for our own building.

163
01:03:28.954 --> 01:03:30.954
LAUGHTER

164
01:03:34.954 --> 01:03:36.954
This is sowing and reaping.

165
01:03:37.954 --> 01:03:41.954
Sowing and reaping, what Ruben said very effectively recently...

166
01:03:41.954 --> 01:03:43.954
Sowing and reaping does not mean...

167
01:03:43.954 --> 01:03:46.954
God is not a vending machine, God is not an ATM...

168
01:03:46.954 --> 01:03:49.954
you put something in and hope that more comes out.

169
01:03:49.954 --> 01:03:53.954
That is not sowing and reaping as the Bible means by sowing and reaping.

170
01:03:53.954 --> 01:03:55.954
Sowing is what we have done now.

171
01:03:55.954 --> 01:03:58.954
We are sowing into Jeroen and Anja.

172
01:03:58.954 --> 01:04:00.954
And do you know what the reaping is?

173
01:04:00.954 --> 01:04:02.954
30, 60, 100-fold.

174
01:04:02.954 --> 01:04:04.954
That is not in your bank account.

175
01:04:04.954 --> 01:04:06.954
That is not at all what the Bible means.

176
01:04:06.954 --> 01:04:08.954
That is a false gospel.

177
01:04:08.954 --> 01:04:10.954
That is completely wrong.

178
01:04:10.954 --> 01:04:12.954
What the Bible means is...

179
01:04:12.954 --> 01:04:14.954
we are sowing into them...

180
01:04:14.954 --> 01:04:16.954
so that people will come to repentance.

181
01:04:16.954 --> 01:04:20.954
So that restoration will come to the world.

182
01:04:20.954 --> 01:04:22.954
30, 60, and 100-fold.

183
01:04:22.954 --> 01:04:25.954
Do you know what a much more beautiful east is?

184
01:04:25.954 --> 01:04:27.954
When you later arrive in heaven...

185
01:04:27.954 --> 01:04:29.954
and you see a 100-fold east...

186
01:04:29.954 --> 01:04:32.954
to people who are in heaven together with you.

187
01:04:32.954 --> 01:04:35.954
What does it matter that you receive back 100-fold?

188
01:04:35.954 --> 01:04:37.954
But...

189
01:04:37.954 --> 01:04:41.954
the nuance of what you may trust...

190
01:04:41.954 --> 01:04:43.954
that is for example with me...

191
01:04:43.954 --> 01:04:45.954
I will give you an example.

192
01:04:45.954 --> 01:04:48.954
I recently took my car to the garage...

193
01:04:48.954 --> 01:04:50.954
with my little Peugeot partner.

194
01:04:50.954 --> 01:04:52.954
That is already...

195
01:04:52.954 --> 01:04:55.954
and I bring it to the garage...

196
01:04:55.954 --> 01:04:58.954
and the mechanic says that will be 1500 euros.

197
01:04:58.954 --> 01:05:00.954
That hurts, doesn't it?

198
01:05:00.954 --> 01:05:02.954
And then I keep driving it.

199
01:05:02.954 --> 01:05:04.954
Everything will be fine with that car.

200
01:05:04.954 --> 01:05:06.954
And then this work van comes...

201
01:05:06.954 --> 01:05:09.954
this mission bus for Jeroen, it's coming soon.

202
01:05:09.954 --> 01:05:11.954
Watch what I do then.

203
01:05:11.954 --> 01:05:14.954
Then I say here, I sow in that bus...

204
01:05:14.954 --> 01:05:17.954
and I trust that it will indeed be alright for me.

205
01:05:17.954 --> 01:05:19.954
That is sowing and reaping.

206
01:05:19.954 --> 01:05:21.954
That is sowing and reaping.

207
01:05:21.954 --> 01:05:24.954
And I can tell you, because they are divine principles.

208
01:05:24.954 --> 01:05:27.954
Just like this, a divine law is gravity.

209
01:05:27.954 --> 01:05:30.954
The laws of God simply work that way.

210
01:05:30.954 --> 01:05:32.954
When I then say...

211
01:05:32.954 --> 01:05:36.954
yes, but I could actually use that 500 euros better myself.

212
01:05:36.954 --> 01:05:38.954
Saving for a better car.

213
01:05:38.954 --> 01:05:42.954
Instead, I sow into someone else's work.

214
01:05:42.954 --> 01:05:46.954
I expect as a harvest that people come to repentance.

215
01:05:46.954 --> 01:05:48.954
That is the true harvest.

216
01:05:48.954 --> 01:05:51.954
But I have the confidence that the Creator takes care of me.

217
01:05:51.954 --> 01:05:53.954
That's it.

218
01:05:53.954 --> 01:05:56.954
I'm not going to say, I sow 500 euros...

219
01:05:56.954 --> 01:05:59.954
and I expect 20,000 euros back, so I can buy a nice car.

220
01:05:59.954 --> 01:06:01.954
Be careful that we don't do that.

221
01:06:01.954 --> 01:06:03.954
That's not what it's about.

222
01:06:03.954 --> 01:06:07.954
I trust that the Creator of heaven and earth will take good care of me.

223
01:06:07.954 --> 01:06:10.954
The Bible says, God gives seed to the sower...

224
01:06:10.954 --> 01:06:12.954
and bread for eating.

225
01:06:12.954 --> 01:06:14.954
Do you understand what I mean?

226
01:06:14.954 --> 01:06:16.954
So it will be alright.

227
01:06:16.954 --> 01:06:19.954
By the way, my little Peugeot is fixed, it drives wonderfully again.

228
01:06:21.954 --> 01:06:25.954
We want to applaud you once again for the work you do.

229
01:06:26.954 --> 01:06:28.954
APPLAUSE

230
01:06:32.954 --> 01:06:34.954
Let me share a little more.

231
01:06:34.954 --> 01:06:36.954
You should thank everyone anyway.

232
01:06:36.954 --> 01:06:38.954
LAUGHTER

233
01:06:40.954 --> 01:06:42.954
Wow.

234
01:06:42.954 --> 01:06:44.954
Open Church, thank you.

235
01:06:46.954 --> 01:06:48.954
You are already doing so much.

236
01:06:49.954 --> 01:06:51.954
Just for the building alone.

237
01:06:51.954 --> 01:06:54.954
Just to support the vision of this church.

238
01:06:54.954 --> 01:06:57.954
Because dear people, there is still a Great East to come.

239
01:06:57.954 --> 01:06:59.954
Amen.

240
01:06:59.954 --> 01:07:01.954
Is that an amen to say amen...

241
01:07:01.954 --> 01:07:04.954
