242
01:07:04.954 --> 01:07:06.954
Dear people, you must believe.

243
01:07:06.954 --> 01:07:08.954
You must hold on.

244
01:07:08.954 --> 01:07:10.954
Why do we have this bus?

245
01:07:10.954 --> 01:07:12.954
Why are we receiving so much money?

246
01:07:12.954 --> 01:07:14.954
It is what Tim says.

247
01:07:14.954 --> 01:07:17.954
We sow into the lives of others.

248
01:07:17.954 --> 01:07:21.954
When we go on a mission trip, we take a budget with us.

249
01:07:22.954 --> 01:07:26.954
And we often give more than we have.

250
01:07:26.954 --> 01:07:29.954
And then you indeed need to have the faith.

251
01:07:29.954 --> 01:07:32.954
It will be alright with us, right Anja?

252
01:07:32.954 --> 01:07:34.954
How many times have you not said...

253
01:07:34.954 --> 01:07:36.954
wow, should we really do that?

254
01:07:36.954 --> 01:07:38.954
Yes.

255
01:07:38.954 --> 01:07:40.954
That is also a good brake, right?

256
01:07:40.954 --> 01:07:42.954
LAUGHTER

257
01:07:42.954 --> 01:07:44.954
Especially when you are emotional...

258
01:07:44.954 --> 01:07:46.954
or impulsive...

259
01:07:46.954 --> 01:07:48.954
it is good to also have a brake.

260
